            </div>两个孩子下半年就要上幼儿园了。想到学区房需要好好挑挑，所以预先看起来了。但对于学区房我又很犹豫。买肯定要买，但是买什么样的，却一直想不清楚。]]></description></item><item><title>鼻音很重的一周</title><link>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E9%BC%BB%E9%9F%B3%E5%BE%88%E9%87%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 22:30:32 +0000</pubDate><author>Luis</author><guid>https://luisy92.win/posts/yiqunshuo/%E8%BD%B6%E5%91%A8%E8%AE%B0--%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83--%E9%BC%BB%E9%9F%B3%E5%BE%88%E9%87%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8/</guid><description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
